Authentication:  Verifies the identity of the user or system trying to access the API,
ensuring they are who they claim to be. This step is necessary for securing APIs

Basic auth - sent auth in request format - username, password sent in request and it is encoded
Digest Auth - sent auth in request format - username, password sent in request and it is encrypted
Bearer token - token sent as part of headers
API key - generate a key and use it in headers
